  "id": "hope",
  "term": "hope",
  "definition": "Hope is a cognitive-motivational state centered on desired future outcomes and the belief that they can be achieved. In psychology, it is commonly understood as involving both the drive to pursue goals and the ability to find workable routes around obstacles, and it is linked with well-being, coping, and resilience.",
